# Build context = the unzipped git archive on the NAS (already excludes
# untracked files); this is belt-and-braces + keeps design docs out.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
dist-deploy
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
data
*.db
*.zip
design-handoff
graphify-out
.claude
.superpowers
.impeccable
.DS_Store
DESIGN.md
PRODUCT.md

# Nested variants — dockerignore root-level patterns do NOT recurse, and
# backend/.env exists on the authoring Mac: a local `docker build` would bake
# secrets into the backend layer without these. Never bake secrets.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/data
**/*.db
**/graphify-out
**/.DS_Store
